WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.200
The tube closes very early.

2
00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:07.660
So when does prevention have to start?

3
00:00:08.683 --> 00:00:14.263
Embryologists date human embryos by Carnegie stages, defined by structure, not by

4
00:00:14.263 --> 00:00:15.263
age.

5
00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:20.247
Counted from fertilization, primary closure is complete by the end of about the

6
00:00:20.247 --> 00:00:21.247
fourth week.

7
00:00:21.717 --> 00:00:25.077
Doctors count pregnancy from the last menstrual period.

8
00:00:25.897 --> 00:00:27.777
That clock starts about two weeks earlier.

9
00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:34.147
Predict. On the doctor's clock, how far along is the pregnancy when the tube has

10
00:00:34.147 --> 00:00:35.147
closed?

11
00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:42.310
About six weeks of pregnancy.

12
00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.190
Many pregnancies are not yet recognized at that point.

13
00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.300
So the vitamin has to be there already.

14
00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:55.093
The first trial enrolled women who had already had an affected pregnancy, so their

15
00:00:55.093 --> 00:00:56.093
risk was high.

16
00:00:56.917 --> 00:01:02.157
Folic acid, started before conception, cut recurrence by about 72

17
00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:05.867
Were 72 of every 100 women spared?

18
00:01:06.787 --> 00:01:09.307
No. That is a relative change.

19
00:01:10.317 --> 00:01:14.837
Without folic acid, about three and a half and a hundred pregnancies were affected.

20
00:01:15.717 --> 00:01:16.717
With it, about 1.

21
00:01:17.667 --> 00:01:21.007
The absolute fall was about 2.5 percentage points.

22
00:01:21.827 --> 00:01:25.267
The relative figure alone does not say how many women benefit.

23
00:01:29.717 --> 00:01:34.217
But most affected babies have mothers with no earlier affected pregnancy.

24
00:01:35.157 --> 00:01:36.437
Can a first case be prevented?

25
00:01:37.517 --> 00:01:43.117
In Hungary, women planning a pregnancy took a multivitamin with folic acid, or trace

26
00:01:43.117 --> 00:01:44.117
elements.

27
00:01:44.617 --> 00:01:49.317
There were six affected pregnancies in the trace-element group, and none with the

28
00:01:49.317 --> 00:01:50.317
multivitamin.

29
00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:55.670
But the numbers were small, and a multivitamin cannot credit folic acid alone.

30
00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:59.920
Folic acid lowers the risk; it does not remove it.

31
00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:05.100
Most mothers of affected babies are not folate deficient by ordinary tests.

32
00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:09.933
In mice, some mutants respond to folate and others do not.

33
00:02:10.753 --> 00:02:13.093
How folate prevents defects is still not known.

34
00:02:17.483 --> 00:02:21.483
Takeaway: the tube often closes before a woman knows she is pregnant.

35
00:02:22.503 --> 00:02:24.043
So folic acid must come first.
